title: mf tag add
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Hierarchical tags]]
kind: reference
summary: The record(s) have the tag (drops more general ancestor tags)

Adds the tag to the selection, creating the entry if needed, then drops the ancestors, the negatives and mixed marks it contradicts, and — for an exclusive tag — the siblings ([[Tag subsumption and exclusivity]]). Prints how many records gained the tag.
